    "description": "Conformance scope+capture reference. Three categories: level (default-scope, max rollup, required, in the banner format); authority (scoped to 'alt', union rollup, excluded from the banner but present in the full format); origin (scoped to 'alt', a capture-value concept whose {value} channel only survives the full format). Mirrors a common authority-scope pattern: alternate-scope categories and capture values drop from the banner projection but travel losslessly as assertions.",
